WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.430
After the English army emerged 
victorious in the Battle of Agincourt,

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:09.500
they then advanced on Paris, the capital
 of the kingdom, and captured it.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.870
The French royal court escaped Paris 
and relocated their royal palace to Chinon.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.640
The Duchy of Burgundy 
severed ties with the royal family,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.500
and allied with the English army.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.540
The region was in a state of chaos.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.140
Uncertain of their fate, 
the suffering and cries of the masses

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.500
could be heard throughout 
the nation of France.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.940
Jeanne? Jeanne?

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.900
What's the matter?

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.700
Oh, it's nothing!

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:17.260
<b>#02 The Girl Called Jeanne</b>

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.770
I pray that the English army 
will return to their own country.

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.120
Return home!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.480
I pray that the war will end.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.020
End!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.870
I pray that my breasts will grow bigger!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.280
Grow bigger?

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:07.880
This is a ritual passed down 
for generations in our Fai Tribe.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.300
Have faith, and you shall be saved!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.790
But the war hasn't ended, at all!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.640
And my breasts...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.670
Oh, you already have visitors.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.550
Don't panic.

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.180
I won't do anything to hurt you.

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.780
Are you...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.750
A black mage?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:28.810
No, that's not it.

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:31.310
I'm a traveling alchemist.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:33.360
Montmorency.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:36.280
We'll be using that ruin.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.400
She's got wings!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:44.810
I've heard that the winged 
are the queens of fairy tribes!

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.240
But the winged shouldn't 
be able to be tamed by humans!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.260
I tamed that man to be my slave.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.540
Wow! Such a big hat!

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:10.470
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.350
Is that a magical potion?

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.840
If I borrow the powers 
of this ruin's presence,

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.660
I may be able to transmute the elixir.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.860
Astaroth was right.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:27.740
This might work out!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:28.620
Boobies!

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:30.620
Boobies!

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.960
Will my breasts grow if I drink that potion?

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.310
They won't!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.250
Isn't it a magical potion?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.880
It's not magic.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.750
It's alchemy.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.260
Alchemy is a very sensitive process.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.940
I'll help!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.380
Don't get in my way!

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.980
Let me help!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.330
Do you know what'll happen if 
the mixture is even slightly off?

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.400
It'll be a disaster!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.140
You idiot!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.270
Let us swear an oath!

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.650
We will...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:04.880
We will...

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.560
...remain best friends forever...

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.660
...even after we graduate from school!

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:20.520
You didn't die from elixir intoxication.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.920
Luck is on your side.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.190
I failed again?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.050
Yes.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.180
Damn it!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.720
You're pathetic.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:34.970
I thought you could transmute the elixir 
within three years with my guidance.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.270
It's been seven years!

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.050
Seven years, more than twice that!

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.520
The process involves stepping 
into the other world,

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.310
so, naturally, the flow
 of time would be different.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.530
You didn't even know that?

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.560
What a loser.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.780
Give me back my precious years of puberty!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.140
Listen well, Montmorency.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.660
You're a man chosen 
to become the next Ulysses.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:03.180
You will put an end to all wars in the world, 
including the Anglo-French War,

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:07.750
and turn this world into 
a utopia for all eternity.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.980
Montmorency, that is why 
I bestowed my knowledge upon you.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.430
So get your act together already! Got it?

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:22.880
Listen... I'm not hoping to end 
all wars or become a king,

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.800
or anything of that magnitude.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.480
You're telling me you have low aspirations?

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.670
What a disappointment!

00:06:28.670 --> 00:06:32.460
You know, you can hoard all the beauties 
in the world if you become a king!

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.700
Not interested.

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.710
You said it like the bratty 
virgin that you are.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:41.670
Aren't you at least partially 
responsible for me being a virgin?

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:47.970
I'm sorry. This is all because 
I got in your way, right?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.510
It's not your fault.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.840
It's my fault for lacking talent.

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:58.900
So don't worry about it.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.100
Montmorency-niichan!

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.170
Don't cry.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.510
I'm La Hire.

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:25.610
I came here to inform you that the
 Burgundian army will strike this region.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:29.290
W-Were you hired by Princess Charlotte?

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.630
Will you protect us?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.600
Yeah.

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:38.470
However, I'll need you to hand over 
all your food in exchange for protection.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.440
Wait!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:51.570
A child?!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.200
Don't hurt anyone!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.450
Please, pretty soldier!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.830
She's so reckless!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.640
What were you going to do 
if she shot without warning?

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:11.070
Why is there a black mage 
in such a remote village?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.380
It's a misunderstanding!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.390
He's an alchemist.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.160
Wh-What's with this girl?!

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.450
There are winged fairies?

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:25.660
How can such a cute creature 
be allowed to exist in this world?!

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.860
This is not good.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.860
We can't hand over everything!

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.320
How can we survive the winter?

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.330
You're getting paid, right?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.580
Maybe get your employer to pay extra?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.730
Even salaries are not being paid on time.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.630
It seems the exiled royal 
family is out of funds.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:54.720
Sorry, but we can't survive 
without on-site payment.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:57.710
Pretty soldier, you can survive 
about half a year without food

00:08:57.710 --> 00:09:00.390
by absorbing the fat on your breast!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.560
I'm not a milk cow!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.640
Damn! She's so cute!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:08.910
Are you really La Hire, notorious for being the biggest troublemaker

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.350
in the mercenary business?

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:13.590
I've always assumed that 
you were a grumpy, old man...

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.440
Wh-What's this?

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.780
Gross!

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.390
Did this guy do something strange to you?

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.490
What do you mean by that?

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.450
Cut that out!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.340
Could that be... an elixir?

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:28.420
Wh-What?!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.060
I get it now...

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:34.160
You must have absorbed 
an unfathomable amount of elixir,

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:38.840
and you have become a vessel 
that can transmute elixir!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.380
Is that even possible?

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:43.930
It shouldn't be, but there's 
no other explanation.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.870
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:46.810
Stay out of it!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:53.120
Simply put, my body can now withstand 
the swallowing of the Philosopher's Stone?

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.730
I can become the next Ulysses?

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:55.630
Yes.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.720
All right!

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:57.820
Hold it!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.550
You can probably only stay as 
Ulysses for three minutes, at most.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:05.340
Your body will keep transmuting elixir, 
which will react with the Philosopher's Stone,

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:08.460
causing it to spiral out of control.

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.210
S-Spiral out of control?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:13.080
What'll happen then?

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.270
I don't know.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.000
This is an unprecedented 
situation, even for me.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:19.900
You may die of madness after 
the stone takes over your mind,

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.220
or you may simply explode.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:25.850
In any case, there can only 
be horrible consequences.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.080
Damn it!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.350
Explain it in a way that we can understand!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.700
Xaintrailles! What's wrong?

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.690
Enemy attack!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:36.640
No way! How could they be here this quick?!

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.570
How should I know?

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.140
Take this!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.020
So heavy!

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.200
Your tiny sword won't be of any use!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.560
Let's head out!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.100
Don't let them enter the town!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.110
These guys will burn down 
the village without a second thought!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:22.410
If you can't wield a sword, 
then maybe you can use black magic...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.990
I told you already! I'm an alchemist!

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.570
Astaroth...

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:27.630
What is it?

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:31.460
How about I pass the elixir 
to La Hire, mouth-to-mouth?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.750
Then I'll let her swallow 
the Philosopher's Stone.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:36.880
I'm sure she'll be able to win—

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:37.760
No!

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:39.630
She's practically a bandit.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:44.040
If she obtains powers beyond her abilities, 
things would only get worse!

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.950
You can't even see that?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:46.490
But...

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:51.640
Absolutely not! I forbid it. 
End of discussion!

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.960
Lord, please protect everyone.

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.260
We must find a new safe haven!

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:00.240
What are you doing?

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.640
You'll be killed if you don't run!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.160
But Jeanne is...

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.480
We must not abandon Jeanne!

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.360
Yeah!

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:19.780
Stop it!

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:22.880
Let's work together 
to protect Jeanne's village!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.120
Yeah!

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:27.950
This fairy tribe consists of 
half-assed spiritual beings

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.760
that couldn't make it to heaven or hell.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:32.140
Exterminate on sight.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:33.740
Charge!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:35.400
Yeah!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.420
Little fairies?

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:39.400
You still don't get it?

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.350
Did you drool out your 
wisdom along with elixir?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.420
What are you trying to say?

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.760
See? There it is again!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.050
What about you? You have a small body, 
so you have a small brain.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.730
That's why you can't come up with a solution!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:49.630
That's an insult!

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.410
But it's true?

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:05.430
H-Human...

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:10.710
Don't burn down Jeanne's village...

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:14.430
Don't dress like a human, you vermin!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.190
Little fairy?!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:23.440
Why would you kill innocent fairies?

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.950
Why?

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:27.160
Why?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.270
I mean, you're such a...

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.860
Hey, where's Jeanne?

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:38.280
Let's make this quick. 
We've wasted enough time.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.620
Here we go.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.680
Damn it! Are you okay?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.640
Hang in there!

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:57.120
The ribbon...

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.270
Don't move!

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.440
But the ribbon...

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:02.490
Hold on.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.170
It's my sister's ribbon.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:11.800
Last year, the English troops 
pillaged us, looking for food.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:13.900
My little sister was killed during the attack...

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.420
I'll become your little sister!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.540
So cheer up!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.920
I wanted to become a princess knight.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:43.900
But they say only nobles can become knights.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:49.650
So... I was trying to end the war with rituals...

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:56.570
If only... I had the power to...

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:59.230
If one becomes something more than human,

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:03.440
one will be banished 
from the Church as a heretic.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.610
Immortality means running away for eternity

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.430
and living alone for eternity.

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:14.840
If you wish to live,

00:15:14.840 --> 00:15:16.960
I will grant you power.

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.950
Huh?

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.100
Don't tell me...

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.870
Yeah, if we let her swallow 
the Philosopher's Stone,

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:25.210
she should be able to assimilate the 
stone's powers and regenerate her flesh.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.720
It's too late!

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:29.880
If we insert the Philosopher's Stone
 directly into her wound...

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.260
Is that the power?

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.450
Yeah.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:40.760
But, Jeanne, if you obtain this power, 
you will no longer be human.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.650
You won't be able to stay in this village.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:47.590
Then where should I go?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.820
Am I going to be all alone?

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:52.430
No, I'll protect you.

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:57.690
From now, until the time you die,

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.850
I'll never let you be alone.

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:14.200
You're a fool beyond belief.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.680
Will this work?

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.320
Could a child assimilate half 
of the Philosopher's Stone?

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.440
I don't know!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.120
No one has ever tried this before!

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.600
It tastes sweet, Montmorency.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.880
It's sweet and hot.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:50.150
Yeah, it feels like 
my body is about to burn up.

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.030
It hurts!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.410
Endure it, Jeanne!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:01.120
I can't stand it! It hurts!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.640
It hurts!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.900
I can't...

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:05.000
Almost there!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:05.940
Hang on!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:09.340
It hurts!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.670
Mom... Mom!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.670
Live through this, Jeanne!

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:24.520
Hey, give me a baiser before we die.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.270
Sorry, but that's a no.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.440
Are you ready to die?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.980
You're the ones who need to be ready.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:34.150
Who's there?!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.310
Jeanne?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.650
You're the girl from earlier.

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.240
You don't even have a weapon.

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.020
How can you fight mercenary soldiers?

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:48.040
Huh? That's mine!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.300
This is the power of Philosopher's Stone?

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:58.510
It feels like power is welling up 
from inside of my body!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.300
You'd better fear me.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:03.180
Beg and cry for mercy!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:06.680
Jeanne... What happened to her?

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.750
This is not even a sword fight.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.670
Yeah, the vermin pillaging the village...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.960
...are to be exterminated on sight!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.340
She's a monster!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:35.340
Retreat!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.350
Wait!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.420
Enough! You've done enough, Jeanne!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.350
Hey, what happened to Jeanne?

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.910
That's what <i>I</i> want to know!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.430
She turned into an evil soldier!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.680
That's not the Jeanne I know!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.060
It's the effect of the Philosopher's Stone.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.400
While the stone grants power, 
it also intensifies emotions.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:58.730
Don't worry. Human beings 
cannot stay as Ulysses for long.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.320
Jeanne is a child,

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:03.290
and she assimilated only half of 
the Philosopher's Stone, so before long...

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.580
You, milk cow!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.440
Milk cow?

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.020
Fight me!

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:13.050
Killing small fry can't satisfy me, 
no matter how many I defeat.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.900
I have to fight someone
 at least as strong as you...

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:16.840
Jeanne!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:18.170
Enough of this already—

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:19.110
Wait!

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.510
You'll get yourself killed.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:25.000
There's one more reason to fight.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.300
Those huge breasts of yours are an eyesore!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.430
Stay back.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:31.810
You were safe?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:34.630
Jeanne?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.440
Th-That's...

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.300
The devil!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.070
Head.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:44.200
Aim for the head.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:48.490
If my brain is destroyed, 
even Ulysses won't be able to survive.

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:50.460
<i>I have to kill her, or I'll be killed!</i>

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:05.640
I knew from the start that 
you would aim for the head.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.470
Then it's easy to block it!

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:10.280
<i>At least it's a cute girl who kills me.</i>

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:11.770
<i>That's the only consolation for me.</i>

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:29.340
It ran out of time, huh?

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.430
Jeanne can only function 
as a Ulysses for three minutes.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.960
The power granted is "acceleration."

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.170
Emotion intensified is... "arrogance."

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:47.180
Mayor, when my parents return,

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.930
please explain it to them.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:53.020
How should I explain it to them?!

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:55.060
Your daughter became a heretical demon?!

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:04.200
Looks like the utopia for eternity 
just got one step further.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.560
Montmorency...

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.300
What do you intend to do now?

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.830
She can never return here.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:15.210
Not only that, she'll be hunted 
down by the inquisition.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.580
It's the opposite.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.600
Jeanne will become a saint, starting today.

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:20.970
A saint?

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:22.360
What do you mean by that?

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:31.770
Jeanne.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.320
Let's go.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.460
Yeah!

00:21:47.010 --> 00:21:49.970
<b>To Be Continued</b>

