Richemont is now a cone-type.

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:29.800
Princess Charlotte's has 
grown into a bell-type!

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:32.800
Episode 3: "To the Scheming Palace."

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:34.230
What type are you?

